# Unique images per section

Do not reuse one generated or stock photograph across multiple marketing sections, pages, or device mockups.

- Every distinct section (hero, features split, Karibu, For dukas, How it works, Contact, phone inset, stockroom, etc.) must have its **own** image, generated or sourced for that scene.
- Do not clone an ellipse that already has an image fill and keep the same `imageHash` on another page.
- Kenyan till/duka scenes must still be specific: different people, time of day, shop type, or crop — not the same duka interior repeated.
- Never fake official M-PESA or Safaricom wordmarks inside photos.
